      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Literally anyone can start up sunday meetups back again, why not do it yourself?\n\nAs for expecting staff presence for every week I think it's a bit unrealistic, not to mention you're comparing to a time where VRchat averaged around 100 or less users to today it's around 6000. I can almost say for sure there are many other things that take priority over staff attending social events on a regular basis.\nMore and regular info from VRchat is always nice, but devblogs and blog posts do serve that already. If you think they're too infrequent then that's a separate topic.\n\nSaying VRchat doesn't care about their PR because there's simply too many people around for them to host these small informal events anymore isn't fair to say imho",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
