      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58c6b8f8227a56787575ebc0|full_name}: In that case, I would appreciate it if someone started hosting Sunday Meetups weekly so VRChat could approve them officially, but that's even less realistic. Sadly, I can't do it myself because of the time zones.",
